  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The &#x2018;Anti-corruption and Rule of Law in South Asia&#x2019; project aims to strengthen national integrity systems working closely with civil society and other keystakeholders. It focuses on improving media and civil society&#x2019;s capacities to leverage existing transparency and accountability mechanisms, enhancing trustand transparency in justice systems, and promoting accountability within governments. Targeting Bangladesh, Maldives, Nepal, and Sri Lanka, the projectsupports social accountability towards b</narrative>
  </description>
